Package: quirinux-createmaster
Version: 0.2.12+q2
Architecture: amd64
Section: system
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Charlie Martinez <cmartinez@quirinux.org>
Homepage: https://quirinux.org
Depends: penguins-eggs | eggs
Recommends: eggs-quirinux-config
Installed-Size: 260
Description: Quirinux createmaster - tool for creating a master derived distro
 Quirinux createmaster is a utility designed to automate the creation
 of a Quirinux-based master distribution. It provides the necessary
 scripts and configuration files to generate a customized derivative
 distro ready for deployment or further customization.
 .
 For full functionality, it is recommended to install penguins-eggs
 and eggs-quirinux-config alongside this package.
